{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No conditional-hook warnings in any of the three scenarios. Now let me verify:\n1. Step/reset functionality works with a `**kwargs` model (do_reset uses `model_parameters.value`).\n2. Parameter changes via on_change work (the kwargs model accepts extra params).\n3. `_check_model_params` behavior — the missing-required/invalid-param errors still fire correctly for non-kwargs models.","thinkingSignature":"[{\"type\":\"reasoning.text\",\"text\":\"No conditional-hook warnings in any of the three scenarios. Now let me verify:\\n1. Step/reset functionality works with a `**kwargs` model (do_reset uses `model_parameters.value`).\\n2. Parameter changes via on_change work (the kwargs model accepts extra params).\\n3. `_check_model_params` behavior — the missing-required/invalid-param errors still fire correctly for non-kwargs models.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"text","text":"No hook warnings in any scenario. Now verify the interactive functionality — stepping, reset (which re-instantiates via `model_parameters.value`), and parameter-change flows with a `**kwargs` model:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e888cd6d728148aeacfaddb0","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /testbed && python - <<'EOF'\nimport warnings\nimport solara\nimport mesa\nfrom mesa.visualization.solara_viz import SolaraViz, Slider, ModelController, ModelCreator\n\nclass KwargsModel(mesa.Model):\n    def __init__(self, num_agents=10, **kwargs):\n        super().__init__(seed=None)\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.running = True\n    def step(self):\n        self.steps += 1\n\ndef dummy(model):\n    return solara.Text(\"x\")\n\n@solara.component\ndef InteractiveHarness(initial_model, params):\n    \"\"\"Simulate SolaraViz wiring: shared reactive model_parameters + controller + creator.\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(initial_model, solara.Reactive):\n        model = solara.use_re